@startuml F3.7-D02-registrar-avaliacao
title F3.7-D02 — Registrar avaliação de TCC
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TccController" as Ctrl
participant "ReviewTccUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Registrar avaliação
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /tccs/{id}/avaliacoes
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  situacao calculada
  pela nota mínima
end note
UC -> Postgres: INSERT tcc_evaluation\n+ UPDATE TCC\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: avaliação registrada

@enduml
